{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28323"},"reason":"New fact: Punxsutawney Phil and Groundhog Day, the American descendant of German Candlemas weather lore – the best-known custom of 2 February.","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punxsutawney_Phil"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Groundhog_Day"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Punxsutawney Phil"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Punxsutawney Phil"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"панксатонский Фил"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[1344,17],"de":[1435,17],"ru":[1374,17]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"event","start":"1887-02-02","end":null,"precision":"day","approx":false,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"First official Groundhog Day at Gobbler's Knob in Punxsutawney","labelDe":"Erster offizieller Murmeltiertag am Gobbler's Knob in Punxsutawney","labelRu":"Первый официальный День сурка на «Индюшачьей горке» в Панксатони"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Punxsutawney_Phil","title":"Punxsutawney Phil – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"d7d3925714ac"},
